  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/IMG_7097.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(66 fotos) La sala La Cassola de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles la story time de Kids&amp;Us school of english. Mientras tanto en el centro situado en la plaza Corts Valencianes, 9 contin&uacute;a la Christmas Fun Weeks hasta el viernes 29 de diciembre.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytimekidsampusdesembre17/img_7066.jpg\" alt=\"img_7066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytimekidsampusdesembre17/img_7069.jpg\" alt=\"img_7069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytimekidsampusdesembre17/img_7072.jpg\" alt=\"img_7072\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytimekidsampusdesembre17/img_7074.jpg\" alt=\"img_7074\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytimekidsampusdesembre17/img_7075.jpg\" alt=\"img_7075\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytimekidsampusdesembre17/img_7076.jpg\" alt=\"img_7076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytimekidsampusdesembre17/img_7078.jpg\" alt=\"img_7078\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytimekidsampusdesembre17/img_7080.jpg\" alt=\"img_7080\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/storytim